  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes public beach access at Wall Street with 1 set of beach chairs included (March 1 - October 31) . Additional beach service chairs can be rented through Jake's Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included. <br><br>Welcome to your perfect vacation retreat in Inlet Beach! This stunning 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom home is nestled in a picturesque neighborhood, just a 5-minute walk from the beach. The community offers a pool that's heated during the winter months, ensuring year-round relaxation and fun. With a prime location and thoughtful amenities, this home is ideal for families or groups looking to enjoy the best of what the area has to offer.<br><br>On the first floor, you'll find an inviting open-concept living space. The living room, featuring a sleeper sofa, flows seamlessly into a fully-equipped kitchen, making it perfect for gathering with family and friends. Also on this floor is a spacious king bedroom and a full bathroom, offering convenience and comfort for guests.<br><br>Moving to the second floor, there are two guest bedrooms. One room is designed with versatility in mind, featuring a queen bed and a twin-over-twin bunk, complete with its own ensuite bathroom. The primary king suite on this floor is a true sanctuary, boasting a luxurious rainfall shower, double vanity, and a large soaking tub. A private balcony off the primary suite offers a peaceful retreat for morning coffee or evening relaxation. For added convenience, the second-floor laundry room is easily accessible to all.<br><br>The third floor offers even more space to unwind. Here, you'll find an additional living area with another sleeper sofa, perfect for extra guests or for lounging after a day at the beach. Step out onto the expansive balcony, which is equipped with an outdoor kitchen, lounge seating, and a dining table—ideal for alfresco dining and entertaining. This floor also features a king bedroom and a shared full bathroom, making it a perfect haven for additional guests.<br><br>This home also comes with four complimentary bikes, and access to the Rosemary Beach Fitness Center & Racquet Club. Whether you're lounging by the pool, biking to the beach, or relaxing on one of the balconies, this home provides the perfect blend of comfort and coastal charm for your Inlet Beach getaway.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sandy Bottoms | Inlet Beach Home 5 Minute Walk to Beach & Private Community Pool"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
