      {
        "author": "Blair E.",
        "date": "2023-10-23T18:06:40Z",
        "id": "6536b630d89f7408ce8daadf",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Oct 24, 2023",
            "id": "eaaa2139-950a-4386-a137-d395e098458c",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Blair! We are glad to hear you had a great time! We are glad you found Sandy Bottoms located at Inlet Beach, FL clean and well-decorated, and that your sister was impressed with the kitchen. We apologize for any noise from the gas station, but we're happy that you were able to enjoy the convenient location and the use of the bikes. We can't wait to welcome you back on your next trip! We would love the opportunity to rebook your stay on the Emerald Coast; contact us directly at Paradise Properties for your next vacation! Our repeat guests get exclusive access to members-only pricing!\n\n\n\n-We enjoyed hosting you and hope to do so again soon!\n-Paradise Team",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Loved this home for our brief stay. It was extremely clean and beautifully and thoughtfully decorated. My sister is a great cook, and she was impressed with how well the kitchen was equipped. The home backs up to a somewhat sketchy gas station, so we got some noise at night from that direction, but, on the plus side, the house is only about 2-3 blocks from the beach. We rode our (thoughtfully provided) bikes there each day, which was wonderful.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Beautifully decorated & great use of space",
        "verified": true
      }
